======================================================================================================
  Section 1.1 publishes 'canonical y_extN = 1.4647; alt y_extN = 1.1513'. If those are the
  closure inversions of g_ext,obs then the pre-registration computed the right quantity and
  the amendments simply did not use it. Test that, and test WHICH KERNEL they belong to.

