S3. THE CORRECTED TARGETS, and whether Amendment 3's CONCLUSIONS survive the correction
======================================================================================================
  Recompute the amendments' own eigenvalues at the closure-inverted Newtonian argument, for
  every footing x g_ext convention x kernel. Then ask -- by computation, not by assertion --
  whether Amendment 3's two load-bearing conclusions still hold:
     (i)  MI sits BELOW the frozen band's lower edge 1.05 on every footing/g_ext
     (ii) gamma_par is SUB-NEWTONIAN (< 1), which is its pre-declared anisotropy sign

  --- kernel alpha = 1 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
